<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ben &amp; Jerry's.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ben &amp; Jerry's.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hambrecht and Quist analyst Jean-Michel Valette said he cut Ben &amp; Jerry's to &quot;underperform&quot; from &quot;hold,&quot; and cut his third quarter estimtes to $46.9 million or $0.23 per share, from $53 million or $0.38 per share.</p>
<p>--Vallette also cut his fiscal 1996 estimates to $0.68 per share from $0.84, and cut his 1997 estimate to $0.85 from $1.08.</p>
<p>--He cited the company's recent announcement that its earnings and revenues would be below expectations in the third quarter, due partly to heavy promotional activity from Haagen-Dazs.</p>
</text>
